WEBVTT

01:00.100 --> 01:02.900
=Daughter of Fortune=

01:02.900 --> 01:05.460
(Adapted from the novel
"Phoenix Palace Dream" by Lan Jiujiu)

01:05.540 --> 01:08.460
=Episode 12=

01:25.330 --> 01:26.599
You thought entering the palace

01:26.599 --> 01:28.560
would bring you wealth and glory?

01:28.600 --> 01:30.890
So what if you've been granted
the title of Lady of Beauty?

01:31.079 --> 01:32.680
His Majesty values the Liu family.

01:33.079 --> 01:34.400
He won't come save you.

01:36.319 --> 01:37.959
The day you entered the palace,

01:38.680 --> 01:40.120
I already left behind a letter

01:40.120 --> 01:41.690
with one of my trusted people
in the palace.

01:42.680 --> 01:44.040
It says that you and Madam Shen

01:44.560 --> 01:45.959
used witchcraft

01:46.159 --> 01:47.439
to curse His Majesty.

01:48.239 --> 01:49.519
If you dare harm me,

01:50.120 --> 01:52.640
that letter will
be delivered to His Majesty.

01:53.239 --> 01:54.480
The entire Shen family

01:54.799 --> 01:56.079
will be buried alongside you.

01:56.280 --> 01:57.519
How dare you frame me!

02:01.239 --> 02:02.640
It's only a letter.

02:03.439 --> 02:05.040
With Dowager Consort Liu backing me,

02:05.120 --> 02:06.359
you can't do a thing.

02:07.760 --> 02:08.919
Tell me,

02:09.759 --> 02:11.439
whose will arrive first?

02:12.400 --> 02:14.439
Your letter,
or His Majesty's secret agents?

02:15.719 --> 02:16.960
How dare you harm me!

02:17.360 --> 02:18.120
Give it to me!

02:20.960 --> 02:23.919
Back then, my mother and I
had Father's favor all to ourselves.

02:24.400 --> 02:25.960
It was your mother,

02:25.960 --> 02:27.400
with no sense of shame,

02:27.879 --> 02:29.080
who seduced Father.

02:29.200 --> 02:31.390
That was because he
himself was fickle and unfaithful.

02:31.479 --> 02:33.039
How can you blame my mother for that?

02:33.039 --> 02:34.159
You still dare talk back?

02:38.210 --> 02:40.199
Do you really think
His Majesty cares about you?

02:40.479 --> 02:43.520
You've been locked up here
for an entire day,

02:43.800 --> 02:45.479
yet His Majesty hasn't even

02:45.639 --> 02:47.240
asked about you once.

02:47.599 --> 02:50.479
Shen Zhinian, just accept your fate.

02:50.759 --> 02:53.280
No one cares whether you live or die.

02:53.680 --> 02:54.840
To me,

02:55.039 --> 02:57.759
you will always be nothing
more than an ant beneath my feet.

02:58.039 --> 02:58.639
Bah!

03:00.300 --> 03:01.590
Carry out the tattoo punishment.

03:29.420 --> 03:34.940
♪Moon sets on palace walls,
breeze hits the gates♪

03:35.900 --> 03:40.479
♪One glance led me
astray for half a lifetime♪

03:40.479 --> 03:41.159
Your Majesty!

03:41.479 --> 03:42.919
Shen Zhinian seduced another man

03:43.039 --> 03:44.080
and behaved immorally.

03:45.719 --> 03:48.280
I acted under
the Dowager Consort's decree.

04:00.599 --> 04:01.879
Shen Nanqiao,

04:02.280 --> 04:03.479
receive the tattoo punishment

04:03.500 --> 04:04.790
and be expelled from the palace.

04:04.840 --> 04:06.080
Your Majesty, spare me!

04:06.280 --> 04:07.560
Your Majesty, spare me!

04:08.439 --> 04:09.319
Your Majesty!

04:09.560 --> 04:11.759
Your Majesty, spare me!

04:12.560 --> 04:14.000
Your Majesty!

04:14.500 --> 04:20.260
♪Time silently scars those left behind♪

04:20.260 --> 04:23.860
♪I walk through the palace
day and night, just for my beloved♪

04:23.860 --> 04:26.000
♪All my tenderness is for you,
I'd stay alone for you♪

04:26.000 --> 04:27.279
Your Majesty, spare me!

04:27.279 --> 04:28.439
Your Majesty!

04:32.399 --> 04:35.040
Young Lady only left
the Cold Palace to save me.

04:35.199 --> 04:37.000
She happened to run into Lady Liu

04:37.519 --> 04:39.879
and begged Her Ladyship to save me.

04:40.120 --> 04:42.199
Luckily, I tasted that dish first.

04:42.600 --> 04:44.700
Otherwise, the one poisoned
would've been Young Lady.

04:50.519 --> 04:51.759
Go back and rest first.

04:52.160 --> 04:52.959
Yes.

05:01.560 --> 05:02.399
Your Majesty.

05:04.120 --> 05:05.319
Weren't you quite capable?

05:06.199 --> 05:08.439
They hit you, yet you didn't fight back?

05:09.439 --> 05:11.120
I'm already injured like this.

05:12.600 --> 05:15.600
Besides, how many people
could I fight alone?

05:16.060 --> 05:18.079
I don't have anyone
powerful enough to protect me.

05:18.560 --> 05:19.720
That sharp tongue of yours

05:20.519 --> 05:21.800
is only used against me.

05:25.800 --> 05:27.240
Today, you saved me.

05:28.759 --> 05:29.720
I'll remember it.

05:31.240 --> 05:32.839
What do you mean "you" and "me"?

05:33.480 --> 05:34.360
How impudent.

05:37.040 --> 05:38.720
Your Majesty treats me well,

05:39.519 --> 05:40.959
so naturally I dare to be bold.

05:45.839 --> 05:46.879
Your Majesty,

05:47.680 --> 05:48.839
come a little closer.

05:49.639 --> 05:50.920
I have something to say.

06:00.759 --> 06:02.000
I...

06:02.800 --> 06:05.240
wish to ask Your Majesty for something.

06:05.720 --> 06:06.480
What is it?

06:07.879 --> 06:09.759
The people in this palace
are treacherous.

06:10.120 --> 06:11.279
I'm afraid

06:12.000 --> 06:13.759
that one day I may offend someone again.

06:14.959 --> 06:17.680
Your Majesty cannot stay
by my side at all times.

06:18.120 --> 06:19.319
So I wish

06:19.680 --> 06:20.879
to ask Your Majesty

06:20.959 --> 06:22.680
for a death-exemption medal.

06:23.120 --> 06:25.279
Do you know who
death-exemption medals are given to?

06:26.100 --> 06:28.480
They're awarded to those who rendered
great service in supporting the ruler,

06:28.480 --> 06:29.759
or saved the ruler's life.

06:31.959 --> 06:33.120
I know.

06:33.759 --> 06:34.959
In the future,

06:35.319 --> 06:36.680
I will surely

06:37.240 --> 06:38.639
risk life and limb for Your Majesty,

06:39.000 --> 06:40.319
shield you from blades and swords,

06:40.720 --> 06:42.120
and brave any danger for you.

06:42.480 --> 06:44.040
Let's wait until you've recovered first.

06:47.120 --> 06:47.959
Yes.

06:53.879 --> 06:55.639
How could His Majesty leave so suddenly?

06:55.639 --> 06:56.800
Now that the treatment's
been interrupted,

06:56.800 --> 06:58.260
who knows whether it can
still be cured properly?

06:58.279 --> 06:59.360
The situation was urgent.

06:59.400 --> 07:00.690
There was truly no other choice.

07:01.600 --> 07:02.890
Just do your best, Physician Lu.

07:03.090 --> 07:04.680
Your Majesty, those words are mistaken.

07:04.700 --> 07:07.079
I accepted the late Consort's
request to care for Your Majesty.

07:07.079 --> 07:08.439
If I fail to cure Your Majesty,

07:08.920 --> 07:11.000
then I can only
repay my crime with death.

07:11.010 --> 07:12.759
With all the time you're wasting talking,

07:13.000 --> 07:14.510
the needles could already be in place.

07:23.199 --> 07:24.759
Who would've thought that one day,

07:24.959 --> 07:26.560
Your Majesty would risk your own life

07:26.560 --> 07:27.720
for the sake of a mere beauty.

07:28.040 --> 07:29.399
She's just a defenseless woman.

07:29.759 --> 07:31.439
If she were to die in my harem,

07:31.639 --> 07:33.480
wouldn't that only make me
seem incompetent?

07:36.759 --> 07:37.639
It's over.

07:38.240 --> 07:39.279
Everything's over.

07:40.040 --> 07:42.560
Now both His Majesty
and Dowager Consort Liu have abandoned us.

07:42.879 --> 07:44.319
My future is ruined.

07:47.439 --> 07:48.560
All because of you.

07:50.560 --> 07:51.319
Lu,

07:51.759 --> 07:52.680
I still have a way.

07:53.720 --> 07:54.720
I know where the thing

07:54.720 --> 07:56.160
Duke Zhen wants most is hidden.

07:56.580 --> 07:57.680
We can seek refuge with him.

07:57.680 --> 07:58.480
What did you say?

08:06.839 --> 08:08.160
Then I'll trust you one more time.

08:10.839 --> 08:11.600
Your Majesty,

08:11.920 --> 08:13.000
the shadow guards discovered

08:13.000 --> 08:14.890
the whereabouts of the Chifeng Army token
at Jinsong Pavilion.

08:14.900 --> 08:16.380
Would Your Majesty like to investigate?

08:16.399 --> 08:17.959
Jinsong Pavilion?

08:18.399 --> 08:19.079
Mm.

08:19.300 --> 08:21.319
But Jinsong Pavilion
is a famous male escort house.

08:21.320 --> 08:22.680
They only receive female guests.

08:23.199 --> 08:25.279
It'll be difficult for us to get in.

08:36.919 --> 08:38.440
What are we going there for?

08:38.720 --> 08:40.720
Why are we dressed like this?

08:41.039 --> 08:42.440
It's just an auction house.

08:43.480 --> 08:44.799
Help me accomplish this,

08:44.800 --> 08:46.639
and I'll grant you
a death-exemption medal.

08:49.919 --> 08:51.559
I will do everything in my power.

08:52.159 --> 08:53.799
- Good.
- Good.

08:53.840 --> 08:55.399
- Wonderful!
- Wonderful!

08:56.399 --> 08:58.240
There's actually
a dragon deity parade tonight.

08:59.000 --> 09:01.590
I heard if you touch the dragon's head,
your wishes will come true.

09:01.840 --> 09:03.320
I want to touch it.

09:03.519 --> 09:04.960
Business first.

09:10.159 --> 09:10.919
Yes.

09:17.039 --> 09:17.919
Fine.

09:18.720 --> 09:19.790
I'll indulge you this once.

09:20.240 --> 09:20.759
Mm.

09:36.220 --> 09:38.980
♪Longing turns to yearning,
twining into a red string♪

09:39.500 --> 09:42.380
♪Drawing your face before my eyes♪

09:44.159 --> 09:44.990
Not playing anymore.

09:47.020 --> 09:50.420
♪How many twists of fate
before we finally meet♪

09:51.180 --> 09:54.220
♪The melody drifts
across rivers and mountains♪

09:54.580 --> 09:57.740
♪Rowing a small boat
with you through passing years♪

09:58.100 --> 10:02.060
♪If the scenery is beautiful,
spring won't feel far away♪

10:02.060 --> 10:05.900
♪I only wish to dance with you
among fluttering flowers and butterflies♪

10:06.460 --> 10:10.140
♪Picking an orchid,
pledging our love forever♪

10:10.140 --> 10:13.180
♪Even if the road to the horizon is long,
may we still share the same moon♪

10:14.759 --> 10:16.440
Please, Dragon Deity, protect Handan.

10:16.440 --> 10:18.799
Protect my maternal family
and keep them safe and well.

10:18.799 --> 10:21.460
♪Then together we'll listen
to the endless wind and snow♪

10:22.399 --> 10:23.200
Wait a moment.

10:25.140 --> 10:28.240
♪As time plays like strings,
youth fades from our faces♪

10:28.240 --> 10:30.279
Please, Dragon Deity, bless His Majesty

10:30.279 --> 10:31.559
with peace and safety,

10:31.840 --> 10:33.279
and may all his wishes come true.

10:54.240 --> 10:56.559
Boss, give me a carp lantern.

10:56.639 --> 10:58.399
Alright.

11:01.759 --> 11:02.879
Thank you.

11:03.960 --> 11:05.360
Offering this in your name.

11:05.370 --> 11:07.190
Thank you for bringing me
to see the lanterns.

11:07.740 --> 11:10.220
♪You do not know♪

11:10.220 --> 11:13.580
♪The partridge's cry
is full of resentment♪

11:16.200 --> 11:17.000
Look!

11:17.159 --> 11:18.600
The sky lanterns are rising.

11:18.759 --> 11:20.039
They're flying so high.

11:20.780 --> 11:27.180
♪Spring breeze passes,
composing the fleeting years♪

11:27.540 --> 11:33.980
♪Clouds on Mount Wu,
no sails on the sea♪

11:34.420 --> 11:41.180
♪Wanting to fold my heart
into a paper kite♪

11:41.180 --> 11:46.000
♪But the ties are too tangled to sever♪

11:46.000 --> 11:46.639
Your Majesty,

11:49.960 --> 11:51.120
why are you late?

11:51.130 --> 11:52.790
I've been here
for quite some time already.

11:52.800 --> 11:55.240
But seeing how happy Your Majesty
and Miss Shen were together,

11:55.600 --> 11:56.840
I didn't wish to interrupt.

12:00.919 --> 12:01.840
Miss Shen,

12:02.080 --> 12:03.440
are your injuries any better?

12:03.679 --> 12:04.559
Much better.

12:04.600 --> 12:05.320
Thank you.

12:07.919 --> 12:09.240
Why did this lantern go out?

12:11.039 --> 12:12.679
It was never lit to begin with.

12:18.000 --> 12:19.879
Your Majesty, today's outfit

12:20.279 --> 12:21.279
is certainly unique.

12:23.799 --> 12:25.080
You sure talk a lot.

12:25.879 --> 12:27.039
Let's go.

12:44.420 --> 12:47.460
(Jin)

12:54.720 --> 12:59.840
♪Broken dreams,
listening to the light rain♪

13:01.560 --> 13:06.800
♪Bitter cold, bringing mist to the eyes♪

13:08.440 --> 13:10.800
♪If we don't meet♪

13:11.000 --> 13:14.240
♪Flowers bloom and fall in shame♪

13:14.440 --> 13:20.960
♪If we meet again,
the peaches will be warm♪

13:21.320 --> 13:27.760
♪Spring breeze passes,
dancing through the years♪

13:28.120 --> 13:34.440
♪Brewing longing,
remembering past lives♪

13:34.960 --> 13:41.640
♪Hard to meet, and just as hard to part♪

13:41.640 --> 13:48.520
♪Who planted the beans
that grew into lotuses?♪

13:48.760 --> 13:54.640
♪Spring breeze passes,
composing the fleeting years♪

13:55.560 --> 14:02.160
♪Clouds on Mount Wu,
no sails on the sea♪

14:02.320 --> 14:09.000
♪Wanting to fold my heart
into a paper kite♪

14:09.280 --> 14:15.720
♪But the ties are too tangled to sever♪
